      "help_zh": "转接目的类型，可选值为AGENT，SKILL_GROUP和EXTERNAL。如果此参数不传，则系统会根据转接的目标号码的格式进行判断，如果发现有判不准确的情况，则需要指定此参数",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "transferee_type",
      "options": [
        "--transferee-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TransfereeType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Automatic",
      "help_en": "The call assignment type. Valid values are Automatic or Manual. If this parameter is empty, the default value is Automatic, which is also the current system's default behavior. When Manual is selected, you must invoke APIs such as ClaimCall to assign the call to a specific agent",
      "help_zh": "话务分配类型，可选参数为自动分配(Automatic)或者手动分配(Manual)。如果此参数为空，则默认为自动分配的方式，这也是当前系统的默认行为。选择手动分配方式时，需要您自己配合调用ClaimCall等接口把电话分给指定的座席",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "routing_type",
      "options": [
        "--routing-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RoutingType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "a=b",
      "help_en": "Ingest endpoint data, primarily used for extension requirements. Regular users do not need to concern themselves with this",
      "help_zh": "随路数据，主要用于扩展需求，普通用户无需关心",
